# Known HIGH/CRITICAL npm advisories in integrations/vercel-ai/package-lock.json (the Vercel AI SDK tools).
# Read by gate.mjs in the CI supply-chain job. One `GHSA-id@package` per line.
#
# Recorded 2026-10-02: `npm audit` reports 0 vulnerabilities at any level, so the
# list is empty and any high/critical advisory fails CI. The guard these tools
# sign through is audited separately (agent-guard.allow).
